      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on an article about how ai is basically gonna make most middle class jobs obsolete in the next decade. i want to make the case that UBI is the only real way to prevent a total societal collapse. can you outline the most convincing arguments for why UBI is the only viable solution to this coming job crisis?",
